  "summary_md": "**monoradio ([@monoradio102](https://x.com/monoradio102/status/2116414021180297532))** puts NVIDIA's **MotionBricks** in the browser over WebGPU. Arrow keys steer a character whose 1–2 s motions are generated in about 0.1 s each between recent frames and preset target poses (made with Kimodo), and your own VRM can be dropped in ([MotionBricks Live](https://huggingface.co/spaces/monoradio/motionbricks-live)).",
